## Reuse policy

{{reuse_policy}}

Managed-service documentation, source-available repositories, and copyleft repositories are
reference material unless the owner explicitly approves their terms and deployment model.
Permissive licensing is necessary but not sufficient: inspect maintenance, security posture,
tests, notices, compatibility, and exact source revision before adapting code.
